{"schema_version":"train72-compact-target24-source-index/1.0","dataset_status":"CANDIDATE_NOT_YET_APPROVED","row_index":1,"case_id":"CT72-L01","density_band":"LOW_0_TO_3","parent_case_id":"TR72-S18","parent_txx_start":"T09","parent_txx_end":"T14","parent_target_sha256":"4a377a70088615ac85141a1cc86406a4832179517272994494232dc29c7c6b59","source_id":"N01","source_path":"finetuning/experiments/T5_R04_TRAIN48_LENGTH_CALIBRATION_20260809_R01/chapters/LC_N01_旧城修表铺_第一章_最后一只摆钟.md","source_chapter_sha256":"5b3b516bab717e43c9a4f98b612887da764cc818fba011a7315f713d644c0555","coordinate_space":"unicode_codepoint_0_based_half_open","target_start":2242,"target_end":2413,"target_sha256":"3dc92bc9bf4b5fa92f2448fb583ce5b23a6f665a27ca5350156e548669f4326f","target_units":[{"id":"T01","parent_unit_id":"T09","start":0,"end":23,"text":"没一会儿，一只白瓷碗送到柜台上，汤面浮着葱花。","text_sha256":"4a4b62a4b90bc02ee3a4ace1fb74347404752f5400921b8ace370713bb8bdddf"},{"id":"T02","parent_unit_id":"T10","start":23,"end":57,"text":"她把面挑松，吹凉一筷子吃一筷子，吃到一半才想起小风扇还朝着空纸杯吹，","text_sha256":"6104e7eafe2ec74d0fd740f3e81368bedc5baa46331f06019a24a9729c8ca8a9"},{"id":"T03","parent_unit_id":"T11","start":57,"end":84,"text":"便伸手把它转过来。风推着额前碎发，面汤的热气往一旁飘。","text_sha256":"08896b4211cc47f4e7249ba74ca9670609ee8330d40148f6cf9e5b10602157ec"},{"id":"T04","parent_unit_id":"T12","start":84,"end":123,"text":"她擦擦嘴，接着吃，瓷勺偶尔碰到碗沿，叮的一声，很快淹没在满墙钟表的滴答里。\n\n","text_sha256":"926d3cb203dbda333b8ed1323c92ce389a1cd60c483b3209c82aed301ab7c8ae"},{"id":"T05","parent_unit_id":"T13","start":123,"end":148,"text":"吃完，她把碗洗净倒扣在窗台。水珠沿瓷边慢慢往下滑。","text_sha256":"a425996db8ebdfea505740f736dce9c4814e518ecb37f88e37d741ed43b1f04e"},{"id":"T06","parent_unit_id":"T14","start":148,"end":171,"text":"她抽了一张旧报纸铺地，跪下去解摆钟底部的棉绳。","text_sha256":"c522666068a4ef948e4bb7d28219279684e3604d7272ca0c5023d616a8ae4fdd"}],"project_original":true,"training_authorized":false}
{"schema_version":"train72-compact-target24-source-index/1.0","dataset_status":"CANDIDATE_NOT_YET_APPROVED","row_index":2,"case_id":"CT72-L02","density_band":"LOW_0_TO_3","parent_case_id":"TR72-M13","parent_txx_start":"T08","parent_txx_end":"T12","parent_target_sha256":"20b59264dd9817ed8ee50744e2a09fd2c14b6b2f1bd5c7fb296a079193a6e2f2","source_id":"N04","source_path":"finetuning/experiments/T5_R04_TRAIN48_LENGTH_CALIBRATION_20260809_R01/chapters/LC_N04_古代盐行_第四章_平码开仓.md","source_chapter_sha256":"bcf5034ff44d971074bf3cac80913e6205f5d745f164c617040ea91cef21bad0","coordinate_space":"unicode_codepoint_0_based_half_open","target_start":242,"target_end":392,"target_sha256":"3e1b0adf8f777883f9b55fdb8717a3a2c6de3fdce3c771385ffccff9aaf58aa5","target_units":[{"id":"T01","parent_unit_id":"T08","start":0,"end":33,"text":"队尾一直折到对街药铺。有人踮脚数仓门上的铜钉，有人把户牌攥得发皱，","text_sha256":"5aac4093d199084bf102e9498a9c1bf996eda6686cc6deb084d614cd65e8858c"},{"id":"T02","parent_unit_id":"T09","start":33,"end":64,"text":"还有个卖花绳的小贩趁乱兜售自家的五彩线，吆喝两声便被众人轰走。","text_sha256":"30526b70e4d6286fef41927641e91f6806cdbf8584e6f0a10df7979019fe8a11"},{"id":"T03","parent_unit_id":"T10","start":64,"end":99,"text":"谢明棠让伙计端来凉水，先给老人和孩子喝。一个穿短褂的汉子嫌自己排得远，","text_sha256":"1972a37983738c9af5f5bd19381e943ee8602731b0b603dc5b7360174bef0e69"},{"id":"T04","parent_unit_id":"T11","start":99,"end":128,"text":"扯着嗓子说盐行做戏，她也不争，只叫阿禾把木栏再往外摆三尺。","text_sha256":"cee9425ea49077dbba5a911b3772cced0a5350a0f6cf78c3d733a75050d83af3"},{"id":"T05","parent_unit_id":"T12","start":128,"end":150,"text":"队伍慢慢顺了，方才那股要掀门的劲便散去不少。","text_sha256":"6eaedd41c602be5bff7f3a8ff329def9d13c4b49619e1a35a306bdec17f618c0"}],"project_original":true,"training_authorized":false}
{"schema_version":"train72-compact-target24-source-index/1.0","dataset_status":"CANDIDATE_NOT_YET_APPROVED","row_index":3,"case_id":"CT72-L03","density_band":"LOW_0_TO_3","parent_case_id":"SUP16-A-01","parent_txx_start":"T01","parent_txx_end":"T05","parent_target_sha256":"1941d168b9bc63bace39baf6984d55fc21c350954e80ff50310175eba73b13f3","source_id":"SRC_A","source_path":"finetuning/experiments/T5_R04_TRAIN72_SUPPLEMENT16_ORIGINAL_SOURCE_CANDIDATES_20260809_R01/chapters/SRC_A_现代关系_第二章_周日的空房间.md","source_chapter_sha256":"16b3550bc7e1083ada90ad828a55778099b0e5aa34019f537a5d37f6bb64a5a6","coordinate_space":"unicode_codepoint_0_based_half_open","target_start":339,"target_end":511,"target_sha256":"f65385473dcc3153c697198cd777cf95a8c2d535b69f989b4cc811d64c28872a","target_units":[{"id":"T01","parent_unit_id":"T01","start":0,"end":39,"text":"夏遥倚在门边看他拆，顺手把头发挽起来。\n\n“你要不要先吃？面再放就坨了。”\n\n","text_sha256":"8861e3577e3747d647bef1a5750fd24b5ecf00f83d8e22c509314d2172f6865c"},{"id":"T02","parent_unit_id":"T02","start":39,"end":75,"text":"“我把客厅走一遍。”\n\n“三十七码的客厅，你走出了巡视厂房的气势。”\n\n","text_sha256":"2d6466f47315bf30fc4f28a4199263c84725313844aee55a6097e9ece97f9f0b"},{"id":"T03","parent_unit_id":"T03","start":75,"end":101,"text":"方峻拎着吸尘器从她脚边经过，故意把风口对准她的袜子。","text_sha256":"d2fc586ff75b789972d755d6a5082dd99a416e3ee6ecdacaa725bf794c3ee0d8"},{"id":"T04","parent_unit_id":"T04","start":101,"end":138,"text":"她往后一躲，脚跟碰到墙，留下浅浅一道灰印。两个人又蹲下来擦墙，谁也没怪谁。","text_sha256":"1042148176c26cffac4b7ebd78d81c743813059da59c6c933a12428642f04fdc"},{"id":"T05","parent_unit_id":"T05","start":138,"end":172,"text":"忙了二十分钟，地上仍旧空空荡荡，只是垃圾袋里多了几张纸和一层灰。\n\n","text_sha256":"02e0f7873f134a5d8a3ed20ea87b8894cdefeee67169f6850b07cfbbe15236ea"}],"project_original":true,"training_authorized":false}
{"schema_version":"train72-compact-target24-source-index/1.0","dataset_status":"CANDIDATE_NOT_YET_APPROVED","row_index":4,"case_id":"CT72-L04","density_band":"LOW_0_TO_3","parent_case_id":"SUP16-A-03","parent_txx_start":"T10","parent_txx_end":"T14","parent_target_sha256":"d0dfa790af8fd565168914203d1860785840d22d790ff3415bff0fbb4223a900","source_id":"SRC_A","source_path":"finetuning/experiments/T5_R04_TRAIN72_SUPPLEMENT16_ORIGINAL_SOURCE_CANDIDATES_20260809_R01/chapters/SRC_A_现代关系_第二章_周日的空房间.md","source_chapter_sha256":"16b3550bc7e1083ada90ad828a55778099b0e5aa34019f537a5d37f6bb64a5a6","coordinate_space":"unicode_codepoint_0_based_half_open","target_start":2622,"target_end":2771,"target_sha256":"83da334ee0ac383a02167efcb52e801ded35b8ecda67359c17fcb9e931862878","target_units":[{"id":"T01","parent_unit_id":"T10","start":0,"end":29,"text":"楼下的孩子不再绕花坛，换成一位老人慢慢收晾晒的小毯子。\n\n","text_sha256":"80756db701486e3078262c1c80e8b0fa0a75632ad485fbc93a2b40cb767a10f5"},{"id":"T02","parent_unit_id":"T11","start":29,"end":59,"text":"屋里没有钟，时间都在太阳里。亮光从窗台的一头慢慢挪到另一头，","text_sha256":"f3a13868b01d65e3f05dcfdb0a6b29ffa753bdbf941cce105c139f2099a4f467"},{"id":"T03","parent_unit_id":"T12","start":59,"end":92,"text":"照出地板上几道没吸干净的细灰。方峻用袜尖蹭了两下，灰尘聚成一小绺。","text_sha256":"1e707a92dbb8242e37e1e2c34febadadeb31a12c36e5edf54bcfd6dba064c7a2"},{"id":"T04","parent_unit_id":"T13","start":92,"end":123,"text":"夏遥把垃圾袋递过去，他弯腰捡起来，袋口在两个人手里轻轻响。\n\n","text_sha256":"b9112110916bdc696f6641acbd9b6153b6acb9d63a5e57522550e988dc9c889e"},{"id":"T05","parent_unit_id":"T14","start":123,"end":149,"text":"谁都没有再说刚才哪句话太重，也没有装作什么都没发生。","text_sha256":"9feee85e044cd131b373dbd47afa913ccd6ad4aab41411eea08447e1c6fb5d03"}],"project_original":true,"training_authorized":false}
{"schema_version":"train72-compact-target24-source-index/1.0","dataset_status":"CANDIDATE_NOT_YET_APPROVED","row_index":5,"case_id":"CT72-L05","density_band":"LOW_0_TO_3","parent_case_id":"SUP16-A-02","parent_txx_start":"T13","parent_txx_end":"T16","parent_target_sha256":"ea4c3cd1c15aa0b2aeaa3853b58306680b8c61e12010f03b4b8e5370f5345055","source_id":"SRC_A","source_path":"finetuning/experiments/T5_R04_TRAIN72_SUPPLEMENT16_ORIGINAL_SOURCE_CANDIDATES_20260809_R01/chapters/SRC_A_现代关系_第二章_周日的空房间.md","source_chapter_sha256":"16b3550bc7e1083ada90ad828a55778099b0e5aa34019f537a5d37f6bb64a5a6","coordinate_space":"unicode_codepoint_0_based_half_open","target_start":1363,"target_end":1504,"target_sha256":"a9e9b4a6e6ef579dfa4f3b7b9d3376f90ad80e2e83a538b47f488f08b339c622","target_units":[{"id":"T01","parent_unit_id":"T13","start":0,"end":31,"text":"四个人——如果把仍在楼下等候的司机算上——隔着门口一小块地砖，","text_sha256":"4dd93c04574ce49b6d4ee687a19b5563bae119211b898a3167b245741ee7b0d7"},{"id":"T02","parent_unit_id":"T14","start":31,"end":67,"text":"一时都不知道下一句该说什么。\n\n“箱子先拿进来吧，堵着门。”夏遥说。\n\n","text_sha256":"3f5747f7fe3988b9df89dad0ec8030492addf4a7baef3bed8e16e8e86465301c"},{"id":"T03","parent_unit_id":"T15","start":67,"end":107,"text":"方宁弯腰去拉，夏遥也伸了手。箱子很沉，轮子轧过门槛时卡了一下，两个人一起抬过去。","text_sha256":"ac10531b80678ee3a4b406ede10d4ffa5388085c420ab4dfc45739074ec3393a"},{"id":"T04","parent_unit_id":"T16","start":107,"end":141,"text":"方峻接第二只，搬到小房间门边，又像忽然意识到位置不对，停在那里。\n\n","text_sha256":"dc1e067cf4cd396914d46d42f5f4113a6f85d87585477196cf5dca2fb151c708"}],"project_original":true,"training_authorized":false}
{"schema_version":"train72-compact-target24-source-index/1.0","dataset_status":"CANDIDATE_NOT_YET_APPROVED","row_index":6,"case_id":"CT72-L06","density_band":"LOW_0_TO_3","parent_case_id":"TR72-M15","parent_txx_start":"T08","parent_txx_end":"T12","parent_target_sha256":"640df53279e7ecba4e9f56397842ff4c92d4118ba825bd2eeecdb92723bc3d66","source_id":"N02","source_path":"finetuning/experiments/T5_R04_TRAIN48_LENGTH_CALIBRATION_20260809_R01/chapters/LC_N02_女子拳馆_第三章_称重前夜.md","source_chapter_sha256":"b8ff9d38cfcf1ac898a3a9de158efab392de5070c92058be86ea8809b0a2b6c4","coordinate_space":"unicode_codepoint_0_based_half_open","target_start":241,"target_end":388,"target_sha256":"001338febf22ef8b106a3376e34780de35b08e16f6c5c83945a24a4ee6a38725","target_units":[{"id":"T01","parent_unit_id":"T08","start":0,"end":28,"text":"高桐把另一台机械秤拖出来，指针晃了几下，稳在五十七点四。","text_sha256":"b21473c5b0be62dc012c9bb1d59f648457c1a8c102893887736949bc001a4501"},{"id":"T02","parent_unit_id":"T09","start":28,"end":58,"text":"两个秤隔着一米，给出了两种命运。\n\n江岚把下午的记录翻出来。","text_sha256":"69df2d9c6fa155a26de9a57daa47d65f11a84edd97cb6cf8c5381b70f9de4710"},{"id":"T03","parent_unit_id":"T10","start":58,"end":86,"text":"出发去赛事中心前，她在馆里称过一次；到那边过检称过一次；","text_sha256":"fd393986eaa33cf34899666937954af3acc60f74e08772a30c27dc61c7154e60"},{"id":"T04","parent_unit_id":"T11","start":86,"end":120,"text":"回来路过社区诊所，又借门口的秤称了一次。三张照片里的数字只差一百克，","text_sha256":"30a03241195a29330c55285f90057a2ca34caa3ed1a6b396d08fe9c35c362cb7"},{"id":"T05","parent_unit_id":"T12","start":120,"end":147,"text":"偏偏赛事方借给拳馆的这台电子秤，像突然学会了撒谎。\n\n","text_sha256":"4f8aa9d283fdd6af561ed4ed1b432f9a39830099b63bcc03f0c92526c6103f5b"}],"project_original":true,"training_authorized":false}
{"schema_version":"train72-compact-target24-source-index/1.0","dataset_status":"CANDIDATE_NOT_YET_APPROVED","row_index":7,"case_id":"CT72-L07","density_band":"LOW_0_TO_3","parent_case_id":"SUP16-C-02","parent_txx_start":"T16","parent_txx_end":"T20","parent_target_sha256":"0d0d787a58321a98b1e09dc88b3aec52867beede2935722ebfabd76c6c37a847","source_id":"SRC_C","source_path":"finetuning/experiments/T5_R04_TRAIN72_SUPPLEMENT16_ORIGINAL_SOURCE_CANDIDATES_20260809_R01/chapters/SRC_C_古代民生_第四章_春水到纸坊.md","source_chapter_sha256":"5f23195c987dd08094e66dda738ff065c24d135bb14d2e49cdc335912a0a8648","coordinate_space":"unicode_codepoint_0_based_half_open","target_start":1228,"target_end":1371,"target_sha256":"7e826406f0c0f816f6b89c83f5a68864ccaeb388cb04792880dc4e282049a809","target_units":[{"id":"T01","parent_unit_id":"T16","start":0,"end":37,"text":"大家手上都是湿的，便只围在锅边看了一眼，等下一槽水来时，又各自回到了原处。","text_sha256":"30086d5322c3ffe7ffbc42b6340ec000f802c7c576b5d81c1b29f719f57cec1d"},{"id":"T02","parent_unit_id":"T17","start":37,"end":61,"text":"纸帘起落，新纸一张叠一张，边角渐渐对得齐了。\n\n","text_sha256":"d1ac6546d13e1233563f3b8d60d246221e691da601cc626b526d17fb4bd890d3"},{"id":"T03","parent_unit_id":"T18","start":61,"end":96,"text":"院墙外有人晒菜干，木板被拍得啪啪响。隔着墙，邻家婆婆问今年头水冷不冷，","text_sha256":"e5e2015438239e4414af53a5b934a42fff28176d4a92944471dd3d36b70b2809"},{"id":"T04","parent_unit_id":"T19","start":96,"end":133,"text":"秦嫂扯着嗓子回了一句“冷得正好醒困”。水声、木槌声和女人们的笑声混在一起，","text_sha256":"5f245d2d4fb1b8f43f930fb1fbe1f8732539066d2e5560fabe3e4b53786200d3"},{"id":"T05","parent_unit_id":"T20","start":133,"end":143,"text":"没谁再念叨早上的事。","text_sha256":"3cadab0f93ae6a8a095c8fa511df3d0df0c032877d77940efe6c6ffc030e9b69"}],"project_original":true,"training_authorized":false}
{"schema_version":"train72-compact-target24-source-index/1.0","dataset_status":"CANDIDATE_NOT_YET_APPROVED","row_index":8,"case_id":"CT72-L08","density_band":"LOW_0_TO_3","parent_case_id":"TR72-M14","parent_txx_start":"T12","parent_txx_end":"T16","parent_target_sha256":"45a6180b4f8bec5f41b41e28ae663356f4ebcbdef2465117de02abd307d35563","source_id":"N06","source_path":"finetuning/experiments/T5_R04_TRAIN48_LENGTH_CALIBRATION_20260809_R01/chapters/LC_N06_深海观测站_第三章_蓝光带偏航.md","source_chapter_sha256":"d2073a96597d4027f1236cc4a54c77752700861a25e0d2049f08bc7a93bc396d","coordinate_space":"unicode_codepoint_0_based_half_open","target_start":316,"target_end":482,"target_sha256":"f9e2da2e80d2905dc75dba5e2ef21ae6d0644c3c1bca5997a57164c1cfa2f7fb","target_units":[{"id":"T01","parent_unit_id":"T12","start":0,"end":38,"text":"周既白早试过了。控制杆压到最左，潜器尾部推进器却隔了两秒才响应，刚转过一点，","text_sha256":"fb2c0e7c91659b516e20539b1d9339253a3714c1cb0ed5675d83ee11cd768b79"},{"id":"T02","parent_unit_id":"T13","start":38,"end":60,"text":"又被那条蓝光带牵回原来的角度。不是水流顶偏。","text_sha256":"7379c94f8e8acea038149346652c0b52e04172809b68c493b2a856a122994a3a"},{"id":"T03","parent_unit_id":"T14","start":60,"end":97,"text":"流速仪显示海水正向西南，光点却沿着相反方向移动，快慢还保持得出奇一致。\n\n","text_sha256":"a98a55b10723ae01fecc23766ac6f0eed2434eeb6b71fcfe3fb69acb6d44e2a8"},{"id":"T04","parent_unit_id":"T15","start":97,"end":126,"text":"沈雁俯身贴近屏幕。每个光点经过镜头时都会收暗一次，像眨眼。","text_sha256":"bab765ef59f42f03903071840d6857f472401febdb1534a90ca3f5ebd57c96b3"},{"id":"T05","parent_unit_id":"T16","start":126,"end":166,"text":"前一夜他们采到的发光水母会随浪翻滚，这些东西却始终离海床半米高，不升也不落。\n\n","text_sha256":"ea64a7b2aed9e054cac7adad6da049d0ae65add523886bc5bbdcf833c08ea312"}],"project_original":true,"training_authorized":false}
{"schema_version":"train72-compact-target24-source-index/1.0","dataset_status":"CANDIDATE_NOT_YET_APPROVED","row_index":9,"case_id":"CT72-L09","density_band":"LOW_0_TO_3","parent_case_id":"TR72-M18","parent_txx_start":"T17","parent_txx_end":"T22","parent_target_sha256":"e8c7e0d15aa7453e571395cf0173ce31976dbc4142ddbb127f401f2fdb4e1f58","source_id":"N03","source_path":"finetuning/experiments/T5_R04_TRAIN48_LENGTH_CALIBRATION_20260809_R01/chapters/LC_N03_星港货运_第二章_失重区封锁.md","source_chapter_sha256":"7432d7f2aafffe8454d94aa26c509ded0825ad3d1f5f867036a6d9a55fb93beb","coordinate_space":"unicode_codepoint_0_based_half_open","target_start":2534,"target_end":2706,"target_sha256":"2f8fd39bfbc09b7e2b88642cb1c498737c7b26769341ae22cbe337a717bc9eed","target_units":[{"id":"T01","parent_unit_id":"T17","start":0,"end":40,"text":"他来不及避开，被架角带得翻了半圈，安全绳一下绷直。\n\n“人还是箱？”维修员吼。\n","text_sha256":"c2579f8823b5cc0ac59e02932357877cb1c5e83e94d72650467562d1230de59a"},{"id":"T02","parent_unit_id":"T18","start":40,"end":61,"text":"\n阮宁左手抱箱，右手抓绳，肩膀被扯得发麻。","text_sha256":"e081ec4982fbc52c24b5869e498bafa2f0ab42bbee806ef73a3360fbde9b1ba1"},{"id":"T03","parent_unit_id":"T19","start":61,"end":87,"text":"她看见温控读数又往上跳了一格，索性用膝盖夹住电源头，","text_sha256":"86b1d5af2a47c07d7875ad39a45be5ea724d71dd4554dac5fce5819341ea4f90"},{"id":"T04","parent_unit_id":"T20","start":87,"end":111,"text":"把自己腰间的牵引扣甩给维修员。\n\n“都要。”\n\n","text_sha256":"9aff2b99a7f768bcfedc94fad0f8c994d4acf4da62938e41c9b388b41810c313"},{"id":"T05","parent_unit_id":"T21","start":111,"end":137,"text":"三分钟后，隔离门外的人先看见一只银灰小箱慢慢飘出来。","text_sha256":"67aede1ffa7745f63c8951f28e57d9348d4d9d692c00b0a0a17c4eb3db86bdcc"},{"id":"T06","parent_unit_id":"T22","start":137,"end":172,"text":"小崔扑上去抱住，紧接着是卡死半边外骨骼的周识，最后才是脸色发白的阮宁。","text_sha256":"d7a1b24b0189ac521bd40d71ca9b4dfd693a9daeeeecf5059b14bc5b4991164f"}],"project_original":true,"training_authorized":false}
{"schema_version":"train72-compact-target24-source-index/1.0","dataset_status":"CANDIDATE_NOT_YET_APPROVED","row_index":10,"case_id":"CT72-L10","density_band":"LOW_0_TO_3","parent_case_id":"TR72-M17","parent_txx_start":"T13","parent_txx_end":"T17","parent_target_sha256":"c0adb062be1ca968fa3c5da42af3ea17e7249f83fed083fe423c21da9252a2d6","source_id":"E04","source_path":"finetuning/experiments/T5_R04_NOVELLIKE_TRAIN36_EXTENSION_20260809_R01/chapters/EXT_E04_野生动物救助_第四章_把金雕留到明天.md","source_chapter_sha256":"20cb5a6e33122f8f3345aecbbb9589d4293efcd91b2b5e7b407ff76d66db7941","coordinate_space":"unicode_codepoint_0_based_half_open","target_start":361,"target_end":511,"target_sha256":"c99d7dc08ec711f4400e9acba3ee81de15a42ecf3af29280908949b6ed153e04","target_units":[{"id":"T01","parent_unit_id":"T13","start":0,"end":27,"text":"方岑没有马上反驳，只问山上的人有没有看到那对成年金雕。","text_sha256":"c2625b2639ef034c1d0de64f08356d22dd4e2df849d591c748ac2509de65a2b6"},{"id":"T02","parent_unit_id":"T14","start":27,"end":53,"text":"无线电回答，雌鸟早晨在东崖出现过一次，雄鸟没有现身；","text_sha256":"179cef49b264ef0bb8387d283533b34bd2dbde7152f4fc3b61f40148e5bb854b"},{"id":"T03","parent_unit_id":"T15","start":53,"end":83,"text":"这条消息只能说明附近仍有同类活动，不能证明今天适合放归。\n\n","text_sha256":"ddcda0dc217adab51efe15c5d62fa591600780f6c35dc28e546632caba2f0e00"},{"id":"T04","parent_unit_id":"T16","start":83,"end":121,"text":"她把报告逐项写到白板上：横风持续、低云遮蔽、放归台碎石松动、同类活动不完整。","text_sha256":"eff191400af0ad0ba64ae5c81c99b15157c096834b1110e9387edc1eeddc7440"},{"id":"T05","parent_unit_id":"T17","start":121,"end":150,"text":"每一条都有明确来源，却没有一条能被改写成“条件良好”。\n\n","text_sha256":"ca9fe06002e3c22d778a64b92696e41912c94156c96ac0c0460a2267241caeb5"}],"project_original":true,"training_authorized":false}
{"schema_version":"train72-compact-target24-source-index/1.0","dataset_status":"CANDIDATE_NOT_YET_APPROVED","row_index":11,"case_id":"CT72-L11","density_band":"LOW_0_TO_3","parent_case_id":"SUP16-C-01","parent_txx_start":"T07","parent_txx_end":"T11","parent_target_sha256":"3d160cd3f0d187c02bba4d05eab34ca686f56e861b7c7e09c87fef98e6df584e","source_id":"SRC_C","source_path":"finetuning/experiments/T5_R04_TRAIN72_SUPPLEMENT16_ORIGINAL_SOURCE_CANDIDATES_20260809_R01/chapters/SRC_C_古代民生_第四章_春水到纸坊.md","source_chapter_sha256":"5f23195c987dd08094e66dda738ff065c24d135bb14d2e49cdc335912a0a8648","coordinate_space":"unicode_codepoint_0_based_half_open","target_start":308,"target_end":481,"target_sha256":"04103b6fe4afabbd709582c3aebb524f99949bee2a4b3ac78460113f4d2538cb","target_units":[{"id":"T01","parent_unit_id":"T07","start":0,"end":33,"text":"莫叔刚喘口气，青禾已经把木槌横卡在板下。“这口水只够我们过一池料。","text_sha256":"8ba9e660321d90b89ba244873392798f4c2e8f485dfdd49d7c811329da9c36d8"},{"id":"T02","parent_unit_id":"T08","start":33,"end":70,"text":"先让东槽转起来，其他的等我去说。”\n\n莫叔两条腿冻得发紫，还不放心那根槌，","text_sha256":"f9598e358170c011e1d317a099f012238776e7159cdf0577b6a53fe19abaa5c0"},{"id":"T03","parent_unit_id":"T09","start":70,"end":106,"text":"双手死死按着。青禾抬脚踩了踩石渠边的泥，看水没有往缝外漏，才冲坊院挥手。","text_sha256":"cb4eaf1236a2b13e28b06143d127c1fb507ccfe883b987f26e452d11af91c4d6"},{"id":"T04","parent_unit_id":"T10","start":106,"end":133,"text":"等在院门口的工人扯开布袋堵住旁沟，那股清水被引得更直，","text_sha256":"4005018a91cf7ff1bb282231a680760c39d16e61e1d2e2b6e87f22fdb9de1e0e"},{"id":"T05","parent_unit_id":"T11","start":133,"end":173,"text":"远处很快传来水轮受力的咯吱声。\n\n她说的“去说”，也就是踩着水往上走了二十步。\n","text_sha256":"2e6ea1c309a5a144420b519a45ce5f72639470bfefa95e7367acc40dfb212d79"}],"project_original":true,"training_authorized":false}
{"schema_version":"train72-compact-target24-source-index/1.0","dataset_status":"CANDIDATE_NOT_YET_APPROVED","row_index":12,"case_id":"CT72-L12","density_band":"LOW_0_TO_3","parent_case_id":"SUP16-C-03","parent_txx_start":"T19","parent_txx_end":"T22","parent_target_sha256":"8e8e47be5534b344e7e99e01d6aabd2493fb2c79ea1d42781d468c9aa1036d71","source_id":"SRC_C","source_path":"finetuning/experiments/T5_R04_TRAIN72_SUPPLEMENT16_ORIGINAL_SOURCE_CANDIDATES_20260809_R01/chapters/SRC_C_古代民生_第四章_春水到纸坊.md","source_chapter_sha256":"5f23195c987dd08094e66dda738ff065c24d135bb14d2e49cdc335912a0a8648","coordinate_space":"unicode_codepoint_0_based_half_open","target_start":2488,"target_end":2620,"target_sha256":"775ccfb84607986c75bb4c3be9ee0866962d1185920e9001f0788e0c5afe6188","target_units":[{"id":"T01","parent_unit_id":"T19","start":0,"end":26,"text":"笑声未落，新通的水头已经越过旧泊口，朝低处拐了个弯。","text_sha256":"0b3eee881fb26e1a2d6015ab43fbca4786a9d73cf92385aa0485ed77d6b2ec1d"},{"id":"T02","parent_unit_id":"T20","start":26,"end":66,"text":"一大股水冲进岸后的桑地，黑土在众人眼前裂开，几排刚冒芽的小桑树齐齐歪向河边。\n\n","text_sha256":"ddd573cd39f6b26c6cfe373dbe6c9ba608bfd747a3c6d614218db5411ce3f02b"},{"id":"T03","parent_unit_id":"T21","start":66,"end":100,"text":"河埂上，桑地的主人周大钳正提着空篮子往回走。他站住了，青禾也站直身。","text_sha256":"8eefd11bf0c1d19e8cc1f7d8c31c37829e4b65adcce118ca58f62a9783a849b2"},{"id":"T04","parent_unit_id":"T22","start":100,"end":132,"text":"两人中间，春水还在往桑地里涌。\n\n来河边看热闹的人一个个收了笑。","text_sha256":"7968c913086757edb99839b0533a6e5ccd15cf18a0febe8b80992a393216e99b"}],"project_original":true,"training_authorized":false}
{"schema_version":"train72-compact-target24-source-index/1.0","dataset_status":"CANDIDATE_NOT_YET_APPROVED","row_index":13,"case_id":"CT72-M01","density_band":"MEDIUM_4_TO_6","parent_case_id":"TR72-M12","parent_txx_start":"T18","parent_txx_end":"T22","parent_target_sha256":"aa9bb075fff7852ffcd289441c5d3f82476d436bd940f877ef59adade40f8a38","source_id":"N05","source_path":"finetuning/experiments/T5_R04_TRAIN48_LENGTH_CALIBRATION_20260809_R01/chapters/LC_N05_宠物托运站_第一章_没上车的边牧.md","source_chapter_sha256":"44e6c0cba7e96edb43ceb14a73bb907e1929f538e05a223ad6de7dc2bf95c3f5","coordinate_space":"unicode_codepoint_0_based_half_open","target_start":540,"target_end":674,"target_sha256":"cea1534c0208e9826dc35a7b0311e7ca51cd1ba10b41cde4e6f2384379eb2836","target_units":[{"id":"T01","parent_unit_id":"T18","start":0,"end":37,"text":"司机在门外骂了一句，又被雨声压没了。冯莉看了眼墙上的钟，没点头，也没反对。","text_sha256":"f6afe9fa72809c57ab994b576162b15e041f91c0839c25e647c1b0a931027f6f"},{"id":"T02","parent_unit_id":"T19","start":37,"end":58,"text":"陆桥走过去按下卷闸门，铁门缓缓落到半人高。","text_sha256":"3b6ba2aa6a40f1d5aa6f41749e057087783d3501cbbad0952500d70a1e2623b2"},{"id":"T03","parent_unit_id":"T20","start":58,"end":85,"text":"他把东侧小门的插销扣死，又叫保安守住通往停车坪的侧廊。","text_sha256":"8d08a5f04ed98c47521c45fbf15634fd17ab73aa3e19d6c45501f430523c8382"},{"id":"T04","parent_unit_id":"T21","start":85,"end":119,"text":"等厢车里最后一只箱笼也被拖出来，众人终于承认，麦芒确实没在车上。\n\n","text_sha256":"ac71d707c8cc98719f72551b75186b76a3b3549b1d03f19b70bb20a77cd8ce44"},{"id":"T05","parent_unit_id":"T22","start":119,"end":134,"text":"问题是，它也不像跑出了站。\n\n","text_sha256":"c22b503d72b0fa5252b5e66581af781e6dd1410a325c397c0b9b8a944ef0f9b3"}],"project_original":true,"training_authorized":false}
{"schema_version":"train72-compact-target24-source-index/1.0","dataset_status":"CANDIDATE_NOT_YET_APPROVED","row_index":14,"case_id":"CT72-M02","density_band":"MEDIUM_4_TO_6","parent_case_id":"TR72-M16","parent_txx_start":"T14","parent_txx_end":"T19","parent_target_sha256":"80838e4b900b5317fa6f09c0a619f4f7a2d1780d8e02cd534f38bc71aea5b81f","source_id":"T03","source_path":"finetuning/experiments/T5_R04_NOVELLIKE_STYLE_CALIBRATION_10BOOKS_20260809_R01/chapters/ORIG_T03_近未来科幻_第四章_城市少了十二秒.md","source_chapter_sha256":"ae27a9d57d2e0489a21064ffdc9d89212d96c06978b23dd34fcb3ee18b2ab985","coordinate_space":"unicode_codepoint_0_based_half_open","target_start":1852,"target_end":2052,"target_sha256":"cd4b7efde9abf858cec3f1180e11a244c7b009bb5555670aa3738b8fddfb0da4","target_units":[{"id":"T01","parent_unit_id":"T14","start":0,"end":27,"text":"他把音频拷进隔离机，没有上传中心。\n\n回到家已经十点。","text_sha256":"9cec99f6979372ac59a87e42bfea53bd370af6232218301bcfd4e40600aedfac"},{"id":"T02","parent_unit_id":"T15","start":27,"end":63,"text":"门锁识别出他，玄关灯自动亮起。冰箱提醒牛奶过期，扫地机器人卡在餐椅下面，","text_sha256":"9ac8b90db1afc4d520c7604d684fb50f0e68646f0ed5c4f477419f04dca625d9"},{"id":"T03","parent_unit_id":"T16","start":63,"end":97,"text":"一切都跟早晨离开时一样。\n\n祁南给自己倒水，顺手点开门口摄像头。\n\n","text_sha256":"51cc2957e2fee812646c3c4f99a4f97ee31ea40539e708f6dcfbe3db6a563d1d"},{"id":"T04","parent_unit_id":"T17","start":97,"end":133,"text":"今天下午，摄像头有一段离线记录。\n\n十七点四十二分零八秒到零二十秒。\n\n","text_sha256":"13c570fd3053fd797b5e7ec68b68c095a8777ba9c531bbcbf2c194725b56d68f"},{"id":"T05","parent_unit_id":"T18","start":133,"end":166,"text":"同样的十二秒。\n\n他家离滨海隧道二十三公里。缺失前，走廊空无一人；","text_sha256":"e281b5714d71fcc1af90d7eda51a79f074a23716ddc80e0146cfc93dbb0ed40d"},{"id":"T06","parent_unit_id":"T19","start":166,"end":200,"text":"缺失后，门垫上多了一只发条报时器。\n\n正一下一下，替屋里数着时间。\n","text_sha256":"bf3eaac4c332c62f94f0ec3738a300c5b533281d795e0c85d8fd8d7d733bd2f8"}],"project_original":true,"training_authorized":false}
{"schema_version":"train72-compact-target24-source-index/1.0","dataset_status":"CANDIDATE_NOT_YET_APPROVED","row_index":15,"case_id":"CT72-M03","density_band":"MEDIUM_4_TO_6","parent_case_id":"SUP16-B-01","parent_txx_start":"T09","parent_txx_end":"T13","parent_target_sha256":"06787c89ed97895003d1b4936df8729a7b9d5153d8462cd079bb2e266dbeb9cf","source_id":"SRC_B","source_path":"finetuning/experiments/T5_R04_TRAIN72_SUPPLEMENT16_ORIGINAL_SOURCE_CANDIDATES_20260809_R01/chapters/SRC_B_现实职业_第一章_凌晨四点的洗衣房.md","source_chapter_sha256":"823037f3e89c16022cafa29f2a704231382875b3f8eca40dc81b3565f43d851e","coordinate_space":"unicode_codepoint_0_based_half_open","target_start":281,"target_end":447,"target_sha256":"68c8c84b6b8cf08cd7e1585d60005f4e55103347ebf365c7f617220bc9cb29cd","target_units":[{"id":"T01","parent_unit_id":"T09","start":0,"end":34,"text":"彭乐负责把每二十条捆成一包。他刚来第六天，数到十七时有人喊了他一声，","text_sha256":"2604282ffc29a7ad6563a90154a60e588beb8a394e500616c9ebc332ffd6d26b"},{"id":"T02","parent_unit_id":"T10","start":34,"end":70,"text":"再回头就不知道数到哪，只能把那摞重新拆开。\n\n卓玫过去帮他理齐边角。\n\n","text_sha256":"6b3c56c45040aa02fa789b8a0b127815e2c627016dea52f991fe46d6315ecf61"},{"id":"T03","parent_unit_id":"T11","start":70,"end":110,"text":"“别在脑子里数，手摸一条，嘴里念一条。”\n\n“念出来不傻吗？”\n\n“少一条才傻。","text_sha256":"e454c3fdb1eec1d46eacf79ac4d4c9b3170970229975ed76fa54375ffc9b9e24"},{"id":"T04","parent_unit_id":"T12","start":110,"end":142,"text":"酒店的人不会因为你长得聪明就少收一条。”\n\n彭乐果真小声念起来。","text_sha256":"b30bd22e3be84211633b31fcc171123465b2d154df9374db5ef0c63c57996368"},{"id":"T05","parent_unit_id":"T13","start":142,"end":166,"text":"念到二十，他拿捆扎带一绕，带子扣反了，又低头拆。","text_sha256":"9bfe92381ec8f07df341207e2052bcbe23424945a56a8860270076aea18100c7"}],"project_original":true,"training_authorized":false}
{"schema_version":"train72-compact-target24-source-index/1.0","dataset_status":"CANDIDATE_NOT_YET_APPROVED","row_index":16,"case_id":"CT72-M04","density_band":"MEDIUM_4_TO_6","parent_case_id":"SUP16-B-02","parent_txx_start":"T11","parent_txx_end":"T14","parent_target_sha256":"dba02223209768445c75412806ee34d1d4cbfc57d6dd71d5e10c51a4968d7f92","source_id":"SRC_B","source_path":"finetuning/experiments/T5_R04_TRAIN72_SUPPLEMENT16_ORIGINAL_SOURCE_CANDIDATES_20260809_R01/chapters/SRC_B_现实职业_第一章_凌晨四点的洗衣房.md","source_chapter_sha256":"823037f3e89c16022cafa29f2a704231382875b3f8eca40dc81b3565f43d851e","coordinate_space":"unicode_codepoint_0_based_half_open","target_start":1801,"target_end":1920,"target_sha256":"70971b2ef8c6764d1aab7d695e3ed2d84ed3bb1aef41ec6c6fb9797a2dfaa9f9","target_units":[{"id":"T01","parent_unit_id":"T11","start":0,"end":24,"text":"对面只说了几句，她背一下挺直了，紧接着又弯下去，","text_sha256":"d6d32a2eb2c640a16c79c2b0db62da3cbe25ed4ad4ab5138f080ea38cd445c18"},{"id":"T02","parent_unit_id":"T12","start":24,"end":58,"text":"像有人突然在她肩上压了一袋湿布草。\n\n卓玫隔着传送带看见她嘴唇发白，","text_sha256":"3e0fd7ffd7fa11f725050e47c7cac1587e974d5a58c75b71338f89f4f2471ddd"},{"id":"T03","parent_unit_id":"T13","start":58,"end":84,"text":"示意彭乐顶住夹布的位置，自己绕过去。\n\n“我爸摔了。","text_sha256":"05d167f10565af9167ba955be150efe6e5edc289ddcce05b228451aac05fd44e"},{"id":"T04","parent_unit_id":"T14","start":84,"end":119,"text":"”甘霞握着手机，“邻居叫了救护车，我弟在外地，医院让我过去签字。”\n\n","text_sha256":"79629e85d08ded27df315c1a9c463751e76b24d599a7c5973f84e57bceffc5f4"}],"project_original":true,"training_authorized":false}
{"schema_version":"train72-compact-target24-source-index/1.0","dataset_status":"CANDIDATE_NOT_YET_APPROVED","row_index":17,"case_id":"CT72-M05","density_band":"MEDIUM_4_TO_6","parent_case_id":"SUP16-D-01","parent_txx_start":"T20","parent_txx_end":"T24","parent_target_sha256":"55eb538cf555cb2c8a6f7e9d6e13e602e534aa9d9d40d0c11f91288a1084e11e","source_id":"SRC_D","source_path":"finetuning/experiments/T5_R04_TRAIN72_SUPPLEMENT16_ORIGINAL_SOURCE_CANDIDATES_20260809_R01/chapters/SRC_D_乡村悬疑_第三章_戏台今晚照常开.md","source_chapter_sha256":"c76fe0b87b65e1a68673a29060b23f13ecb69da895e1bbf3294a1d46ee9eabfd","coordinate_space":"unicode_codepoint_0_based_half_open","target_start":612,"target_end":765,"target_sha256":"e75d3bd0e5e8c83c6472db3b8e4a6df361685ac6b6873ce38e0d260cb007a92b","target_units":[{"id":"T01","parent_unit_id":"T20","start":0,"end":33,"text":"木腿擦过青石板，刺得人牙根发酸。见秋看着两拨人越站越开，没去劝谁。","text_sha256":"73dd128f65a0b6c4542e096a7fb5c3e99fdd9eb2f2a773c3730cf02dd9430627"},{"id":"T02","parent_unit_id":"T21","start":33,"end":71,"text":"她把台口两盏大灯点亮，当着众人把前幕一直拉到头。\n\n“戏台今晚照常开。”\n\n","text_sha256":"c579085be8fa78fa51187d1e3798b96b2d130c792b80ed4dcdb1bc17a798b0f7"},{"id":"T03","parent_unit_id":"T22","start":71,"end":110,"text":"陈虎川盯着她。“你做主？”\n\n“我站台上。”见秋说，“出了声，也先从我脚下出。","text_sha256":"bf809795319dd98a8467331290aafcdcb941163190eb8d8addad542ecc895ecb"},{"id":"T04","parent_unit_id":"T23","start":110,"end":131,"text":"”\n\n这一句没能让人安心，但把争论截断了。","text_sha256":"e13dbc3611971e5483c8405356304c3a97452cfe66957319373e789779c106a0"},{"id":"T05","parent_unit_id":"T24","start":131,"end":153,"text":"陈虎川阴着脸下台，没走，拉了张凳子坐到最后。","text_sha256":"c9c93256e745c76d6fb5ae1cb82de43b1cd73af8c64245038c180a0d946ec17b"}],"project_original":true,"training_authorized":false}
{"schema_version":"train72-compact-target24-source-index/1.0","dataset_status":"CANDIDATE_NOT_YET_APPROVED","row_index":18,"case_id":"CT72-M06","density_band":"MEDIUM_4_TO_6","parent_case_id":"SUP16-D-02","parent_txx_start":"T13","parent_txx_end":"T16","parent_target_sha256":"bace974e8c323f8105065baab5487c92446291de304c18c39d253b88ee80a5f4","source_id":"SRC_D","source_path":"finetuning/experiments/T5_R04_TRAIN72_SUPPLEMENT16_ORIGINAL_SOURCE_CANDIDATES_20260809_R01/chapters/SRC_D_乡村悬疑_第三章_戏台今晚照常开.md","source_chapter_sha256":"c76fe0b87b65e1a68673a29060b23f13ecb69da895e1bbf3294a1d46ee9eabfd","coordinate_space":"unicode_codepoint_0_based_half_open","target_start":1416,"target_end":1549,"target_sha256":"2fe3dc77b798442b6ea8a41c2dd46615df4e77a40a3529e108fb1f5e7e8aace9","target_units":[{"id":"T01","parent_unit_id":"T13","start":0,"end":33,"text":"每走一步，那块旧台板都发出轻微的响声，却再没有第二道声音接她的话。","text_sha256":"053996fdb3777b967dcf6447510b1d426417b305c86311b4c714d1baca92afb6"},{"id":"T02","parent_unit_id":"T14","start":33,"end":61,"text":"她没因此放松，唱腔反而越压越稳，直到水袖在身前落下。\n\n","text_sha256":"e69fc23f3e041be0951a43c4ab651b851deb0972d9e2c7603508d7c4418bef3e"},{"id":"T03","parent_unit_id":"T15","start":61,"end":96,"text":"见秋把那一折唱完，等花婶的最后一声鼓落定，才猛地转身，亲手将后幕拉开。","text_sha256":"6cdf9836dc74df1f8773c8e626724ecfc1316299baac7b8ffe0ed9f517f51fae"},{"id":"T04","parent_unit_id":"T16","start":96,"end":133,"text":"后台没有人，两扇通往竹林的木门被风吹得一开一合。\n\n台下立刻又吵开了。\n\n","text_sha256":"8a19f72cc8d95e9dab7b10525fb4233066af4cc114e2f96afed60484d3c4b03d"}],"project_original":true,"training_authorized":false}
{"schema_version":"train72-compact-target24-source-index/1.0","dataset_status":"CANDIDATE_NOT_YET_APPROVED","row_index":19,"case_id":"CT72-M07","density_band":"MEDIUM_4_TO_6","parent_case_id":"SUP16-D-03","parent_txx_start":"T13","parent_txx_end":"T17","parent_target_sha256":"07f83f1098d8ceff2dce093c8ea7ebc1f26f4a2094456e8f59e6c0a8b3ecf92e","source_id":"SRC_D","source_path":"finetuning/experiments/T5_R04_TRAIN72_SUPPLEMENT16_ORIGINAL_SOURCE_CANDIDATES_20260809_R01/chapters/SRC_D_乡村悬疑_第三章_戏台今晚照常开.md","source_chapter_sha256":"c76fe0b87b65e1a68673a29060b23f13ecb69da895e1bbf3294a1d46ee9eabfd","coordinate_space":"unicode_codepoint_0_based_half_open","target_start":2392,"target_end":2557,"target_sha256":"fcc4ae8debf5d75d5dd617cbbceab84e32c7e3f4143221f200d0d524e0d6249a","target_units":[{"id":"T01","parent_unit_id":"T13","start":0,"end":34,"text":"台上有人松了口气，也有人仍死死看着竹林。\n\n没有陌生的腔调再插进来。","text_sha256":"3dc36e4463dc40ce407f8ba8ef47debc91f3a9517d5954229aff181d5cc3e4ee"},{"id":"T02","parent_unit_id":"T14","start":34,"end":70,"text":"只是这一折唱完后，突然下起了大雨。雨水像一张灰白的帘，从屋檐外直直落下，","text_sha256":"1264b69322d6fbcdd7252baaf261a6669997be884e645f92fb95545c6cd73282"},{"id":"T03","parent_unit_id":"T15","start":70,"end":110,"text":"眨眼就淹没了广场的青石缝。竹林里窄窄的小路变成一股黄水，再没人能顺着那条路进去。","text_sha256":"72e44f0042d1dd8e678b5707ea84a460c32ffe43662fb275e163e8756a32acec"},{"id":"T04","parent_unit_id":"T16","start":110,"end":131,"text":"\n\n陈虎川关掉手电，回头数了一遍台上的人。","text_sha256":"93038a805fef1a82ea0083a86fb9ae5b7ca79e2399e93ff9836d91726fecb29a"},{"id":"T05","parent_unit_id":"T17","start":131,"end":165,"text":"原本坐在前排的、躲在院门里的、闹着要走的，此时都被雨逼到了一座台上。","text_sha256":"df19dcb1fcc13f6426d3d77fbaa55febd9d377dfc0a80784d9e4a98e5dfe83c2"}],"project_original":true,"training_authorized":false}
{"schema_version":"train72-compact-target24-source-index/1.0","dataset_status":"CANDIDATE_NOT_YET_APPROVED","row_index":20,"case_id":"CT72-M08","density_band":"MEDIUM_4_TO_6","parent_case_id":"SUP16-E-01","parent_txx_start":"T17","parent_txx_end":"T21","parent_target_sha256":"5ee3d221a07d5a677d31e6bf3dfb710c9170b30152a062f17f841951c63baacd","source_id":"SRC_E","source_path":"finetuning/experiments/T5_R04_TRAIN72_SUPPLEMENT16_ORIGINAL_SOURCE_CANDIDATES_20260809_R01/chapters/SRC_E_近未来科幻_第二章_月面托儿舱停课日.md","source_chapter_sha256":"a64babda1f43690a174998d6006c891e11d3770e1929b7acb08afea6f5897a85","coordinate_space":"unicode_codepoint_0_based_half_open","target_start":489,"target_end":656,"target_sha256":"79f9a6ab1b9b702d90368a9c017d1ef597858d467a658709afebc5932c1930c1","target_units":[{"id":"T01","parent_unit_id":"T17","start":0,"end":26,"text":"\n两道黄灯沿门框亮起，值勤员戴修带着一股冷气跨进来，","text_sha256":"6ed71c76ce19dccbd66e23c439fd404a04f2a6f9b61a4f7fe07413bcc0b82ac0"},{"id":"T02","parent_unit_id":"T18","start":26,"end":66,"text":"身后跟着两名推空水箱的维护工。黎穗看见那只水箱，先把沾蓝颜料的抹布丢回盆里。\n\n","text_sha256":"19692c329ace195d743778ab75dc6dbb9567694fe9f28e81a3603839ba563466"},{"id":"T03","parent_unit_id":"T19","start":66,"end":106,"text":"“别告诉我又要停水。”她说。\n\n“不是停水。”戴修看了一眼屋里的孩子，“是停课。","text_sha256":"826e0cc19016cccf9b3ef36ac296fed9a7bedb6c55cd18e7b2aff3f105ea4d66"},{"id":"T04","parent_unit_id":"T20","start":106,"end":127,"text":"现在接走，越快越好。”\n\n门口顿时安静了。","text_sha256":"15238c92aaa7bda4ce5fb16117aacc28bbf0cda19a98ac678f5f6513617490da"},{"id":"T05","parent_unit_id":"T21","start":127,"end":167,"text":"还没离开的四位家长齐齐转过身，何俪以为自己困得听错了，直到维护工开始拆净水接口。","text_sha256":"bc17a6536d0723354cb7da401430a02ed6da773a02a499c689421275cf4518e3"}],"project_original":true,"training_authorized":false}
{"schema_version":"train72-compact-target24-source-index/1.0","dataset_status":"CANDIDATE_NOT_YET_APPROVED","row_index":21,"case_id":"CT72-M09","density_band":"MEDIUM_4_TO_6","parent_case_id":"SUP16-E-03","parent_txx_start":"T01","parent_txx_end":"T04","parent_target_sha256":"b87a5ff973eb5f6e8f91d1637c06d35e5efcf5b60b94afa5e3d7a930a7953d2c","source_id":"SRC_E","source_path":"finetuning/experiments/T5_R04_TRAIN72_SUPPLEMENT16_ORIGINAL_SOURCE_CANDIDATES_20260809_R01/chapters/SRC_E_近未来科幻_第二章_月面托儿舱停课日.md","source_chapter_sha256":"a64babda1f43690a174998d6006c891e11d3770e1929b7acb08afea6f5897a85","coordinate_space":"unicode_codepoint_0_based_half_open","target_start":1924,"target_end":2066,"target_sha256":"f936e70bea62e9e76fa0ef1d9c99d03acb0a46495a70afe20835a65c18156ce6","target_units":[{"id":"T01","parent_unit_id":"T01","start":0,"end":39,"text":"“先别把一天当成一整块。”黎穗说，“你给我四小时，我让早班家长交班。午后再关。","text_sha256":"f7501384e2a519cbef8b404b70df1ba89dc3b6147b15f6cc7418837534d32826"},{"id":"T02","parent_unit_id":"T02","start":39,"end":79,"text":"”\n\n乔蔚从门外插话：“四小时后我接走三个，带回居住舱。我的两个，再加豆荚。”\n","text_sha256":"f0267c5d98669f8ab4756c97e2dc491727fc198d2f9ae3f1943243c4fc592fa5"},{"id":"T03","parent_unit_id":"T03","start":79,"end":115,"text":"\n她说完自己先白了脸。居住舱里塞五个人，空气配额会报警，房东也不会高兴。","text_sha256":"bbeb980b3da751cdd23d9c73554d0b78ead1218e0aa0ec29381e35f96cbbc806"},{"id":"T04","parent_unit_id":"T04","start":115,"end":142,"text":"可她没改口，只把双胞胎的外套抱得更紧。\n\n戴修仍不肯。","text_sha256":"660e08a65b358a61ecd955f023d11733621f5f68326f1cfa748d0c334b6aaa02"}],"project_original":true,"training_authorized":false}
{"schema_version":"train72-compact-target24-source-index/1.0","dataset_status":"CANDIDATE_NOT_YET_APPROVED","row_index":22,"case_id":"CT72-M10","density_band":"MEDIUM_4_TO_6","parent_case_id":"SUP16-F-02","parent_txx_start":"T11","parent_txx_end":"T14","parent_target_sha256":"a8a74729bea6d807f529b80ca49dc61bb68a516162211a7435656622e226ca2b","source_id":"SRC_F","source_path":"finetuning/experiments/T5_R04_TRAIN72_SUPPLEMENT16_ORIGINAL_SOURCE_CANDIDATES_20260809_R01/chapters/SRC_F_奇幻行会_第四章_雾城不收赊欠的梦.md","source_chapter_sha256":"0595fe56cd09990370287665702103f013efa4a2c95c4c6ff7f86c6170debfd7","coordinate_space":"unicode_codepoint_0_based_half_open","target_start":1293,"target_end":1432,"target_sha256":"0d8ccbc55b8b95f1c8fde061187f91b9b391cb917e89d21cb295065ecf4bcf17","target_units":[{"id":"T01","parent_unit_id":"T11","start":0,"end":32,"text":"图瓦先开口，复述得又快又顺；说到货品时，他用了“赢过想赢的人”。","text_sha256":"248249d4f3f5c68d37121f7557fdd29145ae6c753b2e1b5dfec184f66356714c"},{"id":"T02","parent_unit_id":"T12","start":32,"end":72,"text":"罗迦立刻打断，说原话是“胜过兄长”。图瓦反驳了一句，舌根骤然泛苦，脸颊跟着抽动。","text_sha256":"edfa1ff7df302f1a69fdf708d0eb1e4e742313f5bd82cb3bb4dc802c54961ee0"},{"id":"T03","parent_unit_id":"T13","start":72,"end":108,"text":"\n\n他改了称呼，但没有独自编造整场梦。罗迦复述时承认自己拒绝了无面胜利，","text_sha256":"e136bfc656956a5ccfc8a67a9611d1204dc1ae8ab0d78baca82d8494067c589f"},{"id":"T04","parent_unit_id":"T14","start":108,"end":139,"text":"因为“若看不见对手，赢了也没意思”；他下单前还和兄长吵过一架。","text_sha256":"fecb9c58ffe251f9fbbe514728eb1992310aa4e37ea6065814b7bb1f9c11ec4c"}],"project_original":true,"training_authorized":false}
{"schema_version":"train72-compact-target24-source-index/1.0","dataset_status":"CANDIDATE_NOT_YET_APPROVED","row_index":23,"case_id":"CT72-M11","density_band":"MEDIUM_4_TO_6","parent_case_id":"SUP16-F-01","parent_txx_start":"T14","parent_txx_end":"T18","parent_target_sha256":"0cc60d6ecef9a1336578fffc4afcce269bde476772beb43de0af3ea5717fd6a4","source_id":"SRC_F","source_path":"finetuning/experiments/T5_R04_TRAIN72_SUPPLEMENT16_ORIGINAL_SOURCE_CANDIDATES_20260809_R01/chapters/SRC_F_奇幻行会_第四章_雾城不收赊欠的梦.md","source_chapter_sha256":"0595fe56cd09990370287665702103f013efa4a2c95c4c6ff7f86c6170debfd7","coordinate_space":"unicode_codepoint_0_based_half_open","target_start":420,"target_end":580,"target_sha256":"bb014e18a0dfc9725e907778cf58a602da50018a55e2df891ef1d14bdce6bd70","target_units":[{"id":"T01","parent_unit_id":"T14","start":0,"end":29,"text":"行会前厅的铜铃在这时响了一声。\n\n声音不急，甚至有点客气。","text_sha256":"2ae88da2b3cdd41f79792249f70ae675de91a9092a7e8af2af70a19935d23d30"},{"id":"T02","parent_unit_id":"T15","start":29,"end":58,"text":"弥桑叼着面包过去开门，看见一高一矮两个男人并排站在台阶下。","text_sha256":"d86ea6c19be89e12f70b94d326542fb045a3a4d4429be2b57fcf1c7976fc4767"},{"id":"T03","parent_unit_id":"T16","start":58,"end":82,"text":"高个子的眼睛布满血丝，身上是织工常穿的靛蓝围裙；","text_sha256":"dfa02d7f986c7b01ffc86b17418965e75a39fae84169a336365624a0e6344f73"},{"id":"T04","parent_unit_id":"T17","start":82,"end":120,"text":"矮个子裹着梦商的紫披肩，脸色比晨雾还冷。\n\n“我们要仲裁。”高个织工说。\n\n","text_sha256":"a8580f96a7f54b6ec694d71eb283569f3cb6c0d78de228c6ae78df8c9cd297ae"},{"id":"T05","parent_unit_id":"T18","start":120,"end":160,"text":"“是他要。”梦商立刻纠正，“我只是不肯白赔。”\n\n弥桑咽下面包，把两人让进前厅。","text_sha256":"6b2e22b14647952964a81124405e2df60e54aed60939b738c7706ce19d4abeff"}],"project_original":true,"training_authorized":false}
{"schema_version":"train72-compact-target24-source-index/1.0","dataset_status":"CANDIDATE_NOT_YET_APPROVED","row_index":24,"case_id":"CT72-M12","density_band":"MEDIUM_4_TO_6","parent_case_id":"SUP16-E-02","parent_txx_start":"T17","parent_txx_end":"T21","parent_target_sha256":"63d253e36d82be5882b129ad49a878a46286e9b03197060370c6cb2f169fe778","source_id":"SRC_E","source_path":"finetuning/experiments/T5_R04_TRAIN72_SUPPLEMENT16_ORIGINAL_SOURCE_CANDIDATES_20260809_R01/chapters/SRC_E_近未来科幻_第二章_月面托儿舱停课日.md","source_chapter_sha256":"a64babda1f43690a174998d6006c891e11d3770e1929b7acb08afea6f5897a85","coordinate_space":"unicode_codepoint_0_based_half_open","target_start":1740,"target_end":1882,"target_sha256":"de7fd44c6d4f6cca89ed6fb460ec007f0e7d6a3a392ff6503febdd26cb6da971","target_units":[{"id":"T01","parent_unit_id":"T17","start":0,"end":39,"text":"一墙之隔的笑声听不真切，只剩轻轻的振动。何俪把掌心按在玻璃上，等那阵振动过去，","text_sha256":"a890dc0d8f330ccbe0bf7e1f7706c94f72e6d8beb5fcee60f5efb93beac5c05f"},{"id":"T02","parent_unit_id":"T18","start":39,"end":68,"text":"才转身去找戴修。\n\n后舱的回收泵确实存着三百六十升清洗水。","text_sha256":"a8d44d12dbeda34580bff0471454946ad36f62bba971f33b1dec04f3ead4a162"},{"id":"T03","parent_unit_id":"T19","start":68,"end":96,"text":"黎穗提出把它改送矿区除尘，换回等量净水。戴修说管线不通，","text_sha256":"ba19d6da5fda760ae37087c6d0e62654231b2ebaa5b36af53783a3f9601ddf11"},{"id":"T04","parent_unit_id":"T20","start":96,"end":121,"text":"何俪便把早餐车拦在接口旁，拆下车底的食品级输送管。","text_sha256":"ff40a428a17d6901fb1999a3e165f155e67a0719cbe184b794697588756dd2b4"},{"id":"T05","parent_unit_id":"T21","start":121,"end":142,"text":"她修的虽是采矿臂，接头规格却认得比谁都快。","text_sha256":"c6a8aed231f9e13a8b7fc79318339824b7aca5e31dfe80f3d4c889778c4261da"}],"project_original":true,"training_authorized":false}
